    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30144" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mustŭlentus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		mustum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>abounding in new wine</i> or <i>must</i> (ante- and post-class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mustulentus auctumnus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 2, p. 116, 20</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, mustulentus aestus (or ventus),
			Plaut. Fragm. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 63 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">415, 15</span></i>.</div>
